{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F5KMp6PUqGEd8qRoE9fRLG","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_1/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# cost-verify-agent-rl — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-17 08:23 UTC | 更新原因: Loop 12 状态同步：h=2 崩溃确认、D059 eval 修复、dual mechanism 精确化、Paper Agent Phase 2\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nMulti-turn agent RL 的 credit assignment 诊断与修复：step-independent GRPO 存在 Advantage Sign Misattribution（梯度方向错误）+ Information Loss（推理 context 截断），episode-level GRPO 消除两者。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research Phase (MVP passed D053) + 审稿进行中 (Group C)\\\\n- **理论**: Sign Misattribution mechanism 三轮 Reviewer 确认收敛 (D058)\\\\n- **实验**: h-sweep 进行中，h=2 seed 1 step 3 已现崩溃 (18.75%→5.47%)\\\\n- **论文写作**: Method + Theoretical Analysis 完成；Introduction + Related Work 进行中\\\\n- **覆盖率**: 1/18 experiments completed (plan_001 only), h-sweep 大批量正在积累\\\\n\\\\n### 关键发现（本轮）\\\\n- D059: h-sweep val 用 truncated context（h=2 val=0%），需 post-hoc full-context eval\\\\n- Dual mechanism 精确分离：Info Loss (恒定 ceiling) vs Sign Misattribution (累积降解)\\\\n- GAE baseline (plan_003b) = verl 原生支持，只需 config 修改（已准备就绪）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] h=2 seed 1 完成 → 确认全面崩溃 + auto_next 自动启动 seed 2\\\\n- [ ] h=2 seed 2 完成 → 运行 analyze_advantage_log.py (plan_004 验证)\\\\n- [ ] post-hoc full-context eval 脚本完成 → 所有 checkpoint 统一 eval\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent 完成 Intro + Related Work + 引用验证\\\\n- [ ] h=5/10 数据到位 → 验证 \\\\\\\"推理可行但训练崩溃\\\\\\\"（最强 sign misattribution 证据）\\\\n- [ ] 全部 h-sweep 15 runs 完成 → 画 cliff figure (plot_hsweep_cliff.py)\\\\n- [ ] 启动 GAE baseline (plan_003b) — config 已就绪，等 GPU\\\\n- [ ] plan_003 multi-seed replication（h-sweep 后）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 本地：bjb1-17606 × 2 GPU (A6000 96GB)，全部分配给 h-sweep\\\\n- h-sweep 预估：15 runs × ~12h/run = ~180h wall clock = ~7.5 天\\\\n- GAE baseline: ~10h（h-sweep 后）\\\\n- 云 GPU：未申请（如需加速可向 Manager 申请）\\\\n\\\\n## 准备就绪（等 GPU）\\\\n- GAE baseline config: `RAGEN/config/_alfworld_gae_baseline.yaml`\\\\n- REINFORCE++ config: `RAGEN/config/_alfworld_reinforce_pp_baseline.yaml`\\\\n- Advantage analysis: `scripts/analyze_advantage_log.py`\\\\n- Cliff figure: `scripts/plot_hsweep_cliff.py`\\\\n- Post-hoc eval: `scripts/eval_checkpoint_full_context.py`（Agent 在写）\\\\n- Watchdog: tmux `hsweep_watchdog` 监控 PID 920380，auto_next 已 patch\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D059 | 2026-05-17 | h-sweep val 用 post-hoc full-context eval 替代 trunca | hsweep_h2_seed1, exp028c |\\\\n| D058 | 2026-05-17 | Theory correction: \\\\\\\"flat advantage\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"γ-attenuate | hsweep_h2_seed1, exp029 |\\\\n| D057 | 2026-05-17 | Early-stop exp029 at step 15 (val=28%, pass@8=92.9 | exp029_episode_level, exp028c_selfguide_recipe |\\\\n| D056 | 2026-05-17 | Negative 复盘发现：episode-level + valid_action_bonus 可 | exp013f, exp029_episode_level |\\\\n| D055 | 2026-05-17 | Dream Review (weak reject) 响应：修正理论框架（γ decay → dua | exp029_episode_level, exp028c_selfguide_recipe |\\\\n| D054 | 2026-05-16 | Post-MVP framing pivot: dual contribution (episode | exp029_episode_level, exp028c_selfguide_recipe |\\\\n| D053 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 通过：episode-level GRPO step 5 val=25%（2x baseli | exp029_episode_level, exp028c_selfguide_recipe |\\\\n| D052 | 2026-05-16 | exp028c 终止：step 10 val success=0%（灾难性崩溃），MVP 确认失败。 | exp028c_selfguide_recipe, exp027_stable_grpo, exp026_step_independent_grpo |\\\\n| D051 | 2026-05-16 | Setup 审计发现 exp028c 非 Self-Guide 有效复现：step-independ | exp028c_selfguide_recipe, exp027_stable_grpo, exp026_step_independent_grpo |\\\\n| D050 | 2026-05-15 | 停止 exp028a（确认与 exp027 功能等价），根因 #2 也被否定，下一步全面对齐 Sel | exp027, exp028a |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3246, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DeUPvea3zbSWVSbyLLCoxZ","s